Hi Ashish,

You need to do solution suggested by @Sivaram

1. Go to bin folder of maven  i.e.  C:\Program Files\apache-maven-3.3.3\bin
2. Open notepad and paste  the text  "%~dp0\mvn.cmd" %*
3. Save the notepad as  C:\Program Files\apache-maven-3.3.3\bin\mvn.bat
4. Restart Rstudio and execute  install_github("repo/SparkR-pkg", ref="branchname", subdir="pkg")

It worked in my case.

Cheers,
Kamlesh

